#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On sale order confirmation, the project template is duplicated for the new "
"project to start (triggered by the Project Management product). <br/>It "
"comes with some predefined tasks and some additional ones directly coming "
"from the sold products:"
msgstr ""
"销售订单确认后，会为新项目复制项目模板以启动项目（由“项目管理”产品触发）。"
"<br/>它包含一些预定义任务，以及直接来自所售产品的一些附加任务："

