#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>CRM module</strong> helps construction companies capture leads "
"from multiple sources, track communications, and schedule follow-ups. <br/"
">You can prioritize high-value opportunities and turn inquiries into "
"profitable projects."
msgstr ""
"<strong>CRM 模块</strong>帮助建筑公司从多个来源获取线索、跟踪沟通并安排跟进。"
"<br/>您可以优先处理高价值商机，并将咨询转化为盈利项目。"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Planning app</strong> schedules tasks, allocates employees, and "
"coordinates equipment use across multiple construction sites."
msgstr ""
"<strong>计划应用</strong>可安排任务、分配员工，并协调多个施工现场的设备使用。"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Projects App</strong> allows you to manage tasks, assign "
"resources, and create milestones for each construction project."
msgstr ""
"<strong>项目应用</strong>让您能够为每个施工项目管理任务、分配资源并创建里程"
"碑。"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Sales App</strong> enables rapid creation of professional "
"quotations. You can use quotation templates, apply discounts, and send "
"polished proposals directly to clients."
msgstr ""
"<strong>销售应用</strong>可快速创建专业报价单。您可以使用报价模板、应用折扣，"
"并将精心制作的方案直接发送给客户。"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid "The construction industries come in two parts:"
msgstr "建筑行业分为两大业务模式："

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The default setting for billing is to invoice all recorded time sheets so "
"that your work can be invoiced directly. You can however easily introduce a "
"time sheet approval process for manager to confirm and correct recorded time:"
msgstr ""
"默认的开票设置是对所有已记录的工时表开票，以便直接为您的工作进行结算。不过，"
"您也可以轻松引入工时表审批流程，让经理确认和更正已记录的工时："

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The end date is affected if recording delivery after the manufacturing order "
"planned end."
msgstr "如果在制造订单计划结束日期之后记录交付，结束日期会受到影响。"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The forecast icon gives me the timeline of consumption for the coming months "
"I have to meet."
msgstr "预测图标为我展示未来几个月必须满足的消耗时间线。"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The module comes on top of the Construction Builder setup providing "
"additional capabilities."
msgstr "此模块在建筑基础版套件设置之上提供额外功能。"

#. module: construction
#: model:product.template,description_sale:construction.product_product_6_product_template
