"internal user, and who is responsible, could be an external partner.<br/>You "
"can share the remark projects to your subcontractors with different "
"privileges to collaborate in your referential!"
msgstr ""
"备注可让您记录备注的责任人（内部用户）和执行人（可能是外部合作伙伴）。<br/>您"
"可以将备注项目以不同权限分享给分包商，共同维护您的参照数据！"

